@startuml
title SSHSS SysML Use-Case Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Owner
actor "Household Member" as Member
actor Guest
actor Installer
actor "Notification Provider" as Provider

rectangle "«system» Sentinel Smart Home Security System" {
  usecase "Arm Stay / Away" as Arm
  usecase "Authenticate User" as Auth
  usecase "Disarm System" as Disarm
  usecase "Monitor Sensors" as Monitor
  usecase "Detect Intrusion" as Detect
  usecase "Activate Siren / Strobe" as Alarm
  usecase "Record Incident Video" as Record
  usecase "Notify Recipients" as Notify
  usecase "View Status and Incident" as View
  usecase "Control Smart Lock / Light" as Control
  usecase "Configure Zones, Users,\nand Retention" as Configure
  usecase "Enroll / Diagnose Device" as Maintain
  usecase "Supervise Power and Health" as Health
}

Owner --> Arm
Owner --> Disarm
Owner --> View
Owner --> Control
Owner --> Configure
Member --> Arm
Member --> Disarm
Member --> View
Member --> Control
Guest --> Disarm
Installer --> Maintain
Provider --> Notify

Arm .> Auth : «include»
Disarm .> Auth : «include»
Control .> Auth : «include»
Configure .> Auth : «include»
Maintain .> Auth : «include»
Detect .> Monitor : «include»
Alarm .> Detect : «extend»\n[armed and valid trigger]
Record .> Detect : «extend»\n[associated camera available]
Notify .> Alarm : «extend»\n[recipient configured]
View .> Auth : «include»
Health .> Notify : «extend»\n[reportable fault]

note bottom of Detect
The control unit evaluates normalized sensor events
against mode, zone policy, delay, and authorization state.
end note
@enduml

